  "description": {
   "en": "Milky Way Village is a charming, rustic town where the Milky Way galaxy illuminates the night sky. At its heart stands Night Compass, a cozy doll shop run by Baek Young-ha and his family. While Young-ha is passionate about creating and repairing dolls, his skills aren’t as refined as his parents’. Still, he’s determined not to let that stop him from pursuing his dream of sharing the joy of handmade dolls with the world - starting with his own community. Welcome to the Milky Way High Doll Club, where Young-ha and his friends navigate the rough patches of youth, one stitch at a time!\n\n---\n- [Original Webtoon \u003cLezhin\u003e](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/galaxy_1)",
   "es-la": "Un pequeño y sencillo pueblo de la Vía Láctea donde puedes ver hermosas galaxias todos los días.  \nUna tienda de muñecas hechas a mano \"Night Compass\" en Hanryeon.  \nYoungha, el hijo del dueño del lugar, hace muñecas por él mismo, no es muy bueno para coser a diferencia de sus padres.  \nEstá por debajo de cero, pero sin darse por vencido.\n\n---\n- [Original Webtoon \u003cLezhin\u003e](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/galaxy_1)",
   "ko": "아름다운 은하수를 매일 볼 수 있는 작고 소박한 은하수 마을.\n그 곳 한켠에 자리잡고 있는 수제 인형가게 '밤의 나침반'. 그 곳의 아들인 영하는 직접 인형을 만들고, 수선하는 부모님과는 다르게 바느질 솜씨가 좋지 못한데..!\n그럼에도 자신의 꿈을 포기하지 않는 영하와 그런 영하를 지켜보는 소꿉친구 우열! 그리고 수수께끼의 전학생 안톤까지..?\n서툴지만 조금씩 성장해나가는 인형부에 어서오세요!\n\n---\n- [Original Webtoon \u003cLezhin\u003e](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/galaxy_1)"
  },
